sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Caller as API caller
    participant RequestLog as requestlog.Middleware<br/>internal/api/http/middleware/requestlog/requestlog.go
    participant AnswerFailures as answerfailures.Middleware<br/>internal/api/http/middleware/answerfailures/answerfailures.go
    participant Auth as authentication.Middleware<br/>internal/api/http/middleware/authentication/authentication.go
    participant Endpoint as endpoint.ItemsHandler<br/>internal/api/http/endpoint/items.go
    participant Log as logging.Middleware<br/>internal/command/middleware/logging/logging.go
    participant Access as access.Middleware<br/>internal/command/middleware/access/access.go
    participant Batch as batchlimit.Middleware<br/>internal/command/middleware/batchlimit/batchlimit.go
    participant Handler as PlanItemsHandler<br/>internal/command/plan_items.go

    Caller->>+RequestLog: POST /v1/items/plan
    RequestLog->>+AnswerFailures: the request
    AnswerFailures->>+Auth: the request
    Note over Auth: API middleware: the token to an identity in the context
    Auth->>+Endpoint: the route of the contract
    Endpoint->>+Log: PlanItems
    Log->>+Access: PlanItems
    Note over Access: command middleware: the command's mark against the identity
    Access->>+Batch: PlanItems
    Note over Batch: command middleware: the size of the batch
    Batch->>+Handler: PlanItems
    Handler-->>-Batch: the result
    Batch-->>-Access: the result
    Access-->>-Log: the result
    Log-->>-Endpoint: the result
    Endpoint-->>-Auth: 200 with JSON
    Auth-->>-AnswerFailures: the answer
    AnswerFailures-->>-RequestLog: a rejection at any step arrives here as google.rpc.Status
    RequestLog-->>-Caller: the answer
